<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54845" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-πλήξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆγος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stricken, struck</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τῶν γυναικῶν</span> Theopomp. Com.<i><span class="en">
				59
			</span></i>: usu. metaph., <i>stricken with amazement, astounded</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τῶν τούτου ἁμαρτημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					6.50
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτολμος καὶ κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.7b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. καὶ περιδεής</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				814f
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ὦσιν οἱ ἵπποι καταπλῆγες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					16.25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shy, bashful</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναίσχυντος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1108a34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EE</u>
				1233b28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				7.233b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>nervous, apprehensive of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Fab.</u>
					14c
				</span></i>
			odd. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Medic.,
				<i>fixed</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμός</span> (in
			paralysis) <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.50
			</span></i>.</div>
